 "source": "Private Function Tried(ByVal which As Long, ByVal folder As String) As String\n    Dim wb As Workbook, ws As Worksheet, co As Object, sh As Object, s As String\n    Set wb = Workbooks.Add(xlWBATWorksheet)\n    Set ws = wb.Worksheets(1)\n    ws.Shapes.AddShape(msoShapeRectangle, 10, 10, 50, 30).Name = \"A\"\n    Set co = ws.ChartObjects.Add(100, 50, 200, 120)\n    ws.Shapes.AddShape(msoShapeRectangle, 20, 200, 50, 30).Name = \"B\"\n    On Error GoTo Failed\n    Select Case which\n    Case 0\n        \n    Case 1\n        co.Visible = False\n    Case 2\n        co.Visible = False: co.Visible = True\n    Case 3\n        co.Locked = False\n    Case 4\n        co.PrintObject = False\n    Case 5\n        co.Placement = xlMove\n    Case 6\n        co.Placement = xlFreeFloating\n    Case 7\n        co.Placement = xlMoveAndSize\n    Case 8\n        co.Placement = 5\n    Case 9\n        s = TypeName(co.BringToFront)\n    Case 10\n        co.SendToBack\n    Case 11\n        s = TypeName(co.SendToBack)\n    Case 12\n        co.SendToBack: co.BringToFront\n    Case 13\n        ws.ChartObjects.Left = 10\n    Case 14\n        ws.ChartObjects.Top = 15.5\n    Case 15\n        ws.ChartObjects.Width = 300\n    Case 16\n        ws.ChartObjects.Height = 90\n    Case 17\n        ws.ChartObjects.Visible = False\n    Case 18\n        ws.ChartObjects.Locked = False\n    Case 19\n        ws.ChartObjects.PrintObject = False\n    Case 20\n        ws.ChartObjects.Placement = xlFreeFloating\n    Case 21\n        s = ws.ChartObjects.Left\n    End Select\n    For Each sh In ws.Shapes: s = s & \"|\" & sh.Name: Next: s = s & \"|\" & co.Left & \",\" & co.Top & \",\" & co.Width & \",\" & co.Height & \",\" & co.Visible & \",\" & co.Locked & \",\" & co.PrintObject & \",\" & co.Placement\n    Tried = \"ok \" & s\nSaved:\n    wb.SaveAs folder & \"\\c\" & which & \".xlsx\", xlOpenXMLWorkbook\n    wb.Close False\n    Exit Function\nFailed:\n    Tried = \"Err \" & Err.Number\n    Resume Saved\nEnd Function\n\nPublic Function Probe(ByVal folder As String) As String\n    Dim i As Long, s As String\n    Application.DisplayAlerts = False\n    For i = 0 To 21\n        s = s & \"@@@\" & Tried(i, folder)\n    Next\n    Application.DisplayAlerts = True\n    Probe = Mid(s, 4)\nEnd Function\n",
